TA[Conservationists' bid to bring lynx back to England after 1,300 years rejected by High Court judge]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135394276.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A conservation group aimed to reintroduce Eurasian lynx to Northumberland's Kielder Forest for ecosystem restoration. After submitting proposals for release, Natural England raised legal concerns based on existing wildlife laws. The conservation organization contested the regulator's refusal, arguing the laws should not conflict. However, the High Court ruled that the Dangerous Wild Animals Act still applied post-release.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/conservationists-sought-to-release-three-lynx-into-englands-kielder-forest-1300-years-after-the-species-vanished-high-court-judge-rejects-groups-regulatory-challenge/articleshow/135394276.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/conservationists-sought-to-release-three-lynx-into-englands-kielder-forest-1300-years-after-the-species-vanished-high-court-judge-rejects-groups-regulatory-challenge/articleshow/135394276.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T02:57:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135394501,imgsize-1586959.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nine-year-old Ethan Sanborn's Kiid Coffee expands to 400+ retailers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135375184.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-nine-ethan-sanborn-was-building-kiid-coffee-with-his-father-by-2026-the-young-founders-beverage-brand-had-reached-more-than-400-retailers/articleshow/135375184